  "description": "A flexible reporting library for .NET that supports multiple export formats (CSV, HTML, PDF, Excel) with customizable templates. Clients can create custom PDF templates by implementing IPdfTemplate and custom Excel templates by implementing IExcelTemplateV2.\n    \n    New in v1.1.0:\n    - Added ClosedXML provider for free, full-featured Excel export.\n    - Added MiniExcel provider for high-performance, low-memory Excel export.",
